    "complete T15 matrix: query consistency, old operation pins, page-ID reuse, missing/corrupt sources, overload recovery, cancellation, shutdown, bounded resource peaks, and nonzero eviction/miss/reconstruction counters": "Passed the A1-off/on and coalesce=false/true matrix. Full paging server suites passed 53/53 in both A1 settings; focused matrix runs cover Query, old-reader retention, checkpoint-debt recovery, disk-capacity recovery, cancellation, shutdown, and missing/corrupt reachable sources. Crash/write/crash recorded nonzero misses, evictions, WAL reconstruction and source reads, bounded category peaks, and the complete two-reopen oracle.",
